  "email_body": "complete email body — signed off with sender name. Tone must match exactly. If final_notice, include specific deadline (3 business days) and mention collections/legal next step. If includeLateFee is true, reference the late fee amount. Include payment instructions if provided.",
  "tone_notes": "one sentence: what makes this tone appropriate for this situation",
  "suggested_follow_up": "when and how to follow up if this email gets no response"
}

